    <string name="screensaver_dialog_title">Set as screensaver</string>
    <string name="screensaver_instructions">Easiest option: in settings, turn on \"Start slideshow when the TV turns on\".\n\nGoogle TV usually hides third-party screensavers. If \"Open system settings\" doesn\'t list AirProject, do this once:\n\n1. Settings › System › About › click \"Android TV OS build\" 7 times.\n2. Settings › System › Developer options › enable USB/Network/Wireless debugging (no cable needed).\n3. From a computer on the same Wi-Fi run:\n\nadb connect &lt;projector-ip&gt;\nadb shell settings put secure screensaver_components %1$s\nadb shell settings put secure screensaver_enabled 1\n\nA firmware update may reset this.</string>
